      "decision_id": "decision-be667dc0-1b36-4791-a0c3-fb46de424399",
      "title": "Retry failed payment webhooks 5 times, waiting 1 to 16 seconds between tries",
      "rationale": "QUESTION: how many times should the API retry a payment webhook that fails? OPTIONS: A, 3 tries, 2 seconds apart. B, 5 tries, doubling the wait from 1 to 16 seconds. C, retry until it works, with a dead-letter queue. WHY B: provider outages almost always end within 30 seconds, and 5 doubling waits cover 31 seconds. The payments agent chose this within the limits Priya set for it.",
